    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Shadow Legion",
    "summary": "Army Faction must be LEGIONES DAEMONICA to field this detachment. Its units gain the abilities below by keyword. Murderer’s Cowl. A SHADOW LEGION KHORNE unit that Advanced may shoot and may declare charges that turn. Penumbral Puppetry. Give SHADOW LEGION TZEENTCH units Stealth. Melee attacks against them take −1 to Hit rolls. Gloam Rot. Attacks against a SHADOW LEGION NURGLE unit take −1 to Wound rolls if their Strength exceeds its Toughness. Shadow’s Caress. Enemy units cannot pick SHADOW LEGION SLAANESH units as targets for snap shooting. Disciples of Be’lakor. Give the Chaos Space Marines’ Dark Pacts rule to SHADOW LEGION UNDIVIDED units and let them use it with this Army Faction. Resolve a qualifying BE’LAKOR’s Dark Pacts Leadership test as an automatic pass. In each qualifying unit, SHADOW LEGION HERETIC ASTARTES models gain Deep Strike.",
